AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY
///////////////////////////

Commander, prepare for immediate deployment.

You are entering the Expeditions Program, a UDF-authorized combat directive encompassing multi-role operations across contested systems. 
These assignments are conducted beyond secured territory, often in volatile or uncharted planetary zones.
Mission types vary and may include: base defense, artifact retrieval, deep-strike sabotage, signal recovery, hostile containment, and strategic extraction.
Your objectives will be transmitted en route via encrypted uplink.
Expect resistance—both conventional and irregular. 
Landing zones may be hot, and planetary conditions are unstable. 
Environmental hazards include subzero temperatures, electrical storms, volcanic activity, and biosphere threats not yet fully catalogued.
You will not have the luxury of sustained support. 
Field improvisation and team cohesion are your best assets.
Intelligence gathered during Expeditions is critical to securing strategic control in the outer systems.

Stay sharp. Stay mobile. Complete the mission.

- UDF Central Command